{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pdtGraceSeconds","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A session is normally started before the content player has loaded its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source, so the scheduler’s first ticks see no PDT even on a stream that does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry it. Those ticks make no scheduling decision, rather than matching breaks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the system clock — which runs ahead of the live playhead by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream’s latency and would fire a break early (PLAYG-360)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"backstop, not a fixed delay"}]},{"type":"text","text":". The SDK stops waiting at whichever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comes first: content has been playing for ~1s and still exposes no PDT (direct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence about the stream — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DA-PDT-MISSING"},{"type":"text","text":" is emitted once and the clock"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes over immediately, so a join-in-progress break is not delayed below the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tune-in minimum), or this window elapses (the backstop for a player that never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"starts)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" to fall back to the system clock immediately. Has no effect on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pts"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase manifests. Mirrors the web "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pdtGraceSeconds"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK","doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig\/pdtgraceseconds"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig\/pdtGraceSeconds"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pdtGraceSeconds"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"}],"title":"pdtGraceSeconds","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:14OptiViewAdsSDK0abC6ConfigV15pdtGraceSecondsSdvp","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long, in seconds, to wait for the stream’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wallclock"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase session before concluding the stream carries none."}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAdsConfig":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig","title":"OptiViewAdsConfig","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Org-level SDK configuration, fixed for the lifetime of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OptiViewAds"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OptiViewAdsConfig"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OptiViewAdsConfig","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"OptiViewAdsSDK","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The player-agnostic orchestration layer of the OptiView Ads SDK: the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAds"},{"type":"text","text":" entry point,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its configuration, the public event stream and structured diagnostics."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk","role":"collection"},"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAdsConfig/pdtGraceSeconds":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pdtGraceSeconds"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig\/pdtGraceSeconds","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long, in seconds, to wait for the stream’s "},{"code":"EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"wallclock","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase session before concluding the stream carries none."}],"title":"pdtGraceSeconds","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig\/pdtgraceseconds"},"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAds":{"abst